# NAME: CustomAI
# AIProxy domains MagicRule does not cover: AI services without a separate list, and gaps in its Grok and Cloudflare lists.
# Grok and Cursor, which Grok Bot runs on, come from MagicRule.

# Meta AI and Muse, including the Meta Model API (api.meta.ai), its developer site (dev.meta.ai) and Llama.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaivm.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,llama.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,llamameta.net
DOMAIN,ai.meta.com
DOMAIN,ai.developer.meta.com
DOMAIN,aidemos.meta.com
DOMAIN,llama.developer.meta.com

# Grok user content and assets, missing from MagicRule's Grok list.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grokusercontent.com

# Grok Bot; its apps otherwise use Cursor's domains.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grokbot.com

# Cloudflare Mirrors (Arch Linux and Debian), missing from MagicRule's Cloudflare list.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflaremirrors.com
